### Eliminar un comentario de un job — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/deleteComment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobCommentId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/deleteComment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobCommentId": 1
}

### Validación: sin jobCommentId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/deleteComment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Validación: jobCommentId menor o igual a 0 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/deleteComment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobCommentId": 0
}
